cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AstroTouch in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "AstroTouch: tactile 3D-printable models from astronomical images"
abstract: >
  AstroTouch turns astronomical images (FITS files and pictures) into 3D-printable tactile relief models with
  braille labels, for astronomy outreach with blind and visually impaired people.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Peres Afonso"
    given-names: "Enzo"
version: "0.2.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/enzoperesafonso/AstroTouch"
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - accessibility
  - tactile graphics
  - 3D printing
  - braille
